  "Software Details": "ソフトウェアの詳細",
  "The Partial Payment Module in eCommerceGo SAAS enables you to provide your customers with the flexibility of paying for their purchases in manageable installments. This feature is particularly beneficial for high-ticket items, making your products more accessible to a broader audience. By offering installment plans, you not only enhance customer satisfaction but also increase your sales potential. This flexibility allows customers to make larger purchases without the immediate burden of paying the full amount upfront, fostering a more positive buying experience.": "eCommerceGo SAAS の部分支払いモジュールを使用すると、管理可能な分割払いで購入代金を支払う柔軟性を顧客に提供できます。",
  "View Live Demo": "ライブデモを見る",
  "Control Over Deposits": "預金の管理",
  "Customize the payment experience by enabling or disabling the force deposit button according to your business requirements. This feature allows you to decide whether an initial deposit is necessary for your customers to begin the installment plan. Having control over this setting ensures that you can adapt the payment process to suit different scenarios and customer preferences. This flexibility helps you maintain a balance between securing a commitment from the customer and providing a convenient payment option.": "ビジネス要件に応じて強制入金ボタンを有効または無効にして、支払いエクスペリエンスをカスタマイズします。",
  "Comprehensive Payment History": "包括的な支払い履歴",
  "The Partial Payment Module offers a comprehensive view of all partial payments made by your customers. You can effortlessly access detailed payment histories, including dates, amounts, and payment methods. This transparency helps you maintain accurate records, making it easier to manage finances and address any customer inquiries regarding their payment schedules. By having a clear and organized history of payments, you can ensure better financial management and customer service.": "部分支払いモジュールは、顧客が行ったすべての部分支払いの包括的なビューを提供します。",
  "Real-Time Payment Status": "リアルタイムの支払いステータス",
  "Stay informed about the status of each installment with real-time payment tracking. The module clearly indicates whether a payment has been made or is still pending. This feature helps you keep track of outstanding balances, ensuring that you can follow up with customers promptly and manage your cash flow more effectively. Knowing the payment status at a glance allows you to make informed decisions and take necessary actions to ensure timely payments.": "リアルタイムの支払い追跡により、各分割払いのステータスを常に把握できます。",
